# Maestral's ignore list, which home/nixOS.nix links as
# ~/Dropbox (Maestral)/.mignore. Gitignore syntax, relative to the
# Dropbox folder.
#
# Maestral reads it only when sync starts. A pattern that matches an
# item already on Dropbox deletes it there and keeps it on disk.
#
# Every pattern but the first stays under */src, the source tree that
# ~/src links to: outside it, archives and scores keep real content in
# directories named target/ or out/. A name goes in only if no
# repository commits it on purpose, a stricter rule than that of
# config/gitignore, git's global ignore list.

# This file: Home Manager links it from the Nix store.
/.mignore

# Git worktrees. Their commits live in the repository's .git; their
# uncommitted edits are not backed up.
*/src/**/.worktree/
*/src/**/.worktrees/

# Emacs: backups, auto-saves, lock files, native compilation.
*/src/**/*~
*/src/**/#*#
*/src/**/.#*
*/src/**/eln-cache/

# Clojure: tools.deps, shadow-cljs, clj-kondo, clojure-lsp, nREPL, Leiningen.
*/src/**/.cpcache/
*/src/**/.shadow-cljs/
*/src/**/.clj-kondo/.cache/
*/src/**/.lsp/.cache/
*/src/**/.nrepl-port
*/src/**/.lein-*

# Java, Clojure and Rust: Maven, Leiningen and Cargo output, Gradle.
*/src/**/target/
*/src/**/.gradle/

# Python
